{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/78f129852921a4afc8112f19bb6053a0.webp?t=1623787428\" width=582 height=61 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ring of Fire is a detective noir puzzler set in the solarpunk utopia of New London.</h2><br>You play as Detective Grosvenor, a jaded, middle-aged woman hunting through the still-dark corners of the city in pursuit of a radicalised serial killer.<br><br><strong>Using your powers of deduction</strong> you must solve the brutally gruesome murders of the Ring of Fire killer. Examine clues, interrogate key suspects, and cross-reference your findings in the police database to uncover the mystery.<br><br><strong>SEARCH</strong><br>Solve the case using text entry, meaning you can\u2019t brute force the puzzle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/afc669799570e0d3d6f565aa89469ab9.poster.avif?t=1623787428\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/afc669799570e0d3d6f565aa89469ab9.webm?t=1623787428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/afc669799570e0d3d6f565aa89469ab9.mp4?t=1623787428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>INTERVIEW</strong><br>Push your suspects to the brink through branching cinematic conversations with meaningful consequences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/3e7c848b24ee93364a45106b1b9d02e3.poster.avif?t=1623787428\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/3e7c848b24ee93364a45106b1b9d02e3.webm?t=1623787428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/3e7c848b24ee93364a45106b1b9d02e3.mp4?t=1623787428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong><br>Explore the 3D crime scene to examine evidence both visually and textually.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/d3fbc8c42f8f79c7b09ff73780e484d5.poster.avif?t=1623787428\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/d3fbc8c42f8f79c7b09ff73780e484d5.webm?t=1623787428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/d3fbc8c42f8f79c7b09ff73780e484d5.mp4?t=1623787428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/extras/ec8af28d4b34d37f6e4ca3f40ac273a5.webp?t=1623787428\" width=460 height=61 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1353950?t=1623787428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1623787428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1623787428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1623787428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Ring of Fire: Prologue contains blood, profanity, descriptions of extreme violence, reference to murder, descriptions of nudity, implied use of tobacco, and implied sexual abuse of a minor."},"demos":